  "name": "Coconut Curry Leaf and Turmeric Lentils",
  "subtitle": "A fragrant, creamy lentil batch with warm spices and coconut",
  "description": "Cook lentils with tempered aromatics, turmeric, spices, stock, and coconut milk until tender and saucy.",
